{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser rows Roy and Sabrine around until they are thouroughly lost, before stopping the boat. \"How have the pair of you been? i take it the letters reached you alright?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:58:16.366000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T05:58:22.859000Z","id":"870545815465259108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Usually doing better when I'm not being watched all the time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:59:00.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870546001994326016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'Was the invisible pigeon in my airship you as well, might I ask?'","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:59:34.927000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870546144973963264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod to roy before looking to Sabrine. \"No, I have nothing to do with pigeons. Now then, I suppose you wish to know what this is all about?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:15:26.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870550138035273759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"`Pigeons are a mystery. Trust me, I've been one.` 'Shh, Kukudh. I am curious as to what needed such secrecy that us two couldn't just show up together.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:17:01.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870550533201608734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"That would be nice, yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:17:06.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870550554638680084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They smile. \"I represent a small part of the revolution. We wish for you to join our ranks officially\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:18:03.608000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870550795119132672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Which part?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:18:54.874000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551010144297020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I and my twin work together to oversee much of the legal and illegal goods transport, though we do various other things. I cannot guaranteed give you a direct in to other parts of the revolution, but we know people.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:20:38.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551445714391101","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'Finn amongst others, I'm guessing?'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:21:23.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551635296923690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"In this city, I think everyone knows Finn by now.\" Roy shrugs.","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:21:44.954000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551723511537664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They shrug. \"I am not at liberty to reveal names beyond my own until you answer a few questions. Does that sound agreeable?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:22:23.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551884690227200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'I can understand the need for secrecy, yes.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:22:44.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870551971617177640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Depends on what you intend to ask. We're working on something else of importance for fixing some of this city's problems as well, that we can't share right now. If you've been watching us all the time, you might have noticed a place where you couldn't see us. If you won't put our involvement there at risk, I can answer some questions. I hope that sounds agreeable.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:26:54.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870553019756990525","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"I sincerely hope that nothing i need to know nor any involvement with our group would conflict with any efforts to help Empire city.\" They pass you each a mug of a foaming, fizzy liquid procured from seemingly nowhere. \"Drink, if you would.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:28:52.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870553515125260379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'...might I ask what this is?'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:29:01.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870553555709349958","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'I mean no offense, but I have been tricked by fae before, and given where we are...'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:29:22.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870553643978461234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"Perfectly understandable. It's a simple truth drink to prevent you from lying about any of the answers you give here. Nothing more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:30:15.770000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T06:30:19.969000Z","id":"870553866029113374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Does it force us to answer questions, or just ensure what we say is true? Also a pity we didn't get to win the booze at the game booth, where I'm from it's impolite to leave someone out of a drink.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:31:36.700000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870554205474144297","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"It's not actually alcoholic.\" They smile. \"And don't you worry about me. But no, it won't force you to say anything, just stop you from telling untruths.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:32:29.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870554425998061618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'Might I ask... what about mentioning unknowns? If you're going to ask about what I think you are, my situation is... slightly complicated.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:33:10.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870554600342704149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"It's also impolite where I'm from to pressure others when they want to drinking. Na zdrovye.\" Roy takes the mug and drinks from it.","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:33:32.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870554692059549716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"If you're talking about memory loss, i don't believe that'll prove difficult.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:34:09.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870554844593782794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'...to a degree. Well, you'll find out.' she takes a drink from the mug too, before helping Kukudh take one. 'Strictly, they're a part of me, but I feel it's better to be safe.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:35:08.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555093513154601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"Better safe than sorry.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:35:25.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555165055401986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Seeing Kukudh drink too, \"My bugs don't speak. They are bugs, after all.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:35:40.926000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555229832220732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"The drink tastes warm and fizzy. You are unabel to lie to Prosser for the next hour.\n(to clarify about unknowns, it works so that if you don't know, that doesn't count)","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:36:16.717000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T06:58:14.920000Z","id":"870555379950567454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"(so if you don't know something to be the case and say it isn't you're fine)","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:36:29.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555434946265089","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"(alright, so as I thought, saying 'this is all I know about the situation' is alright)","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:36:37.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555465300455444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Do any of you have any aliases or other identities besides the ones you are currently using?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:36:48.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555512205352990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I used to be called the night shifter back when I worked at the docks before the damn redcoats put in the damn curfew. Now only I really call myself that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:38:26.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870555925113630790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'While I go by Sabrine Lovlatar, my real name is Sab Louhi. Back when I was, ah, a walking corpse, I called myself a lady, though I don't do that any more. Both Kukudh and I get nicknamed by shortened forms of our names occasionally, too - while they have never used any other name, to either of our knowledge, they do have other forms they occasionally use besides the imp or pigeon ones.'\nKukudh transforms into a raven, a crab-like spider, and a rat in quick succession, before back to an imp. `My forms changed recently, they used to be creepier. I don't think I can go back to those ones, but they were pretty distinct.`","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:40:47.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870556516476928001","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"The figure nods. \"Do you, or have you ever, worked for the british crown? if so, for what reason, at what time, and what were your duties?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:41:52.943000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870556790184624169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'This is where it potentially gets difficult. While I can say with certainty that, unless one of our friends is a double agent - which I very much doubt - I as myself and Kukudh have not, I cannot speak the same for... whoever was in my first body before I died. The Ravens said that isn't me when I asked them, and I have been trying to put the matter aside, but given I know nothing of before my first death - not even how much of the body I awoke in was mine - I cannot be absolutely sure that *someone in my old body* has not worked for the crown. Just that I have not to the best of my knowledge.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:45:03.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870557590692712489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"'That body is dead now, properly dead, however.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:45:52.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870557796368781363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I worked at the docks running repairs for whoever needed it. Almost all of the ships were people in cases like ours who couldn't do repairs themselves, and if someone felt like still flying the Jack, that was their business. Maybe once or twice I got to look at the regulars' engine, but they paid crap, and then put in the damn curfew, so I just avoided their machines.\"\nRoy thinks for a moment.\n\"Does being disguised as a redcoat count? Cause we had one pretty grand heist at one of their airports, stealing their flagship from right under their noses, and blasting said noses into the ground with artillery.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:46:41.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870558002346881074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser chuckles to Roy. \"If it does count, it's more than excusable. And as for you\" turning to Sabrine. \"If the ravens themselves say it isn't you, then that's more than enough for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:47:48.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870558281070952489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Do you have any intention of sharing any secrets you learn from us with those not a part of our organization?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:48:09.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870558370858414140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"None. Especially that you're polite to not dig into our mission.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:50:26.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870558945553547284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
